        "reason": "Exact unchanged accepted whole profile from content input /home/enpasos/projects/skillpilot/tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/95dc-BY587-scoped-P-requirement-author-successor-v1/REVIEW-INPUT.clean-only95dc-BY587-scoped-P-and-two-unchanged-cases.json @ sha256:c1abca5c74b77e991865839a30ec551bad061e365bb7f8d17d26d6ddd093b899; paired science: tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/source-epa-nutrition-successor-independent-a-v1/FOLLOWUP.95dc-R1-and-9b-M.json @ sha256:a591b34d9ef39c88fe150378dd846251068b0f3da05918100c94dbeef46888ee; tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/source-epa-nutrition-successor-independent-b-v1/FOLLOWUP.95dc-R1-and-9b-M.json @ sha256:1f40b2ee4118872d4df7cdd6d227a042fa8450865e68439bf6702214a83dea5e. Actual current goal, reviewed-resource bytes and profile fingerprints computed by unchanged stock functions in this physical capsule. This is technical serialization, not a new scientific vote. Scoped source requirements and source optionality remain separate exact-bound context. Isolated inactive L7 candidate only; no new independent science or formal reviewRunId; no Human Approval, Human Trial, current native-D or M7 claim.",
        "evidenceLevel": "E1",
