        "reason": "Explicit fixed-temperature equilibrium concentrations in both fresh-task languages and four profile copies resolve original finding MWG-FRESH-EQUILIBRIUM-PREMISE-01. Independently recomputed K=Q=.50^2/.10^2=25 and reversed K=.04; both complete cases and whole profile supported in curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-10-16/chemie-native15-five-P-successors-fresh-independent-science-20261016-v1/informed-mwg-equilibrium-premise/SCIENCE.INFORMED.whole-MWG-equilibrium-premise-followup.json. Original FIRST REVISE remains unchanged; this record serializes its same-reviewer informed successor disposition, not another independent vote. Prospective E0/G0 author-material design candidate only; measured is a supplied fictional premise, not an observed real measurement, learner or experiment.",
