        "reason": "All four factors and collision-theory limits are explicit relationships. Both cases and their fresh counterconditions support qualitative explanation and controlled reasoning; no quantitative law or performed experiment is invented. Bound to sealed FIRST curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-10-16/chemie-native15-five-whole-P-findings-targeted-author-successor-20261016-v1/P5.complete-whole-profile-author-successors.json; exact after-profile fingerprint pinned in FIRST.science.five-whole-P-successors.record.json. This is technical serialization of that same scientific decision, not another independent review. E/G describes only the identified public authored artifact/design, never actual learner performance or a performed experiment.",
        "evidenceLevel": "E1",
